  "data": {
    "body": "Refer to the graph below that shows the domestic market for soybeans at the world price and the impact of a tariff. Assume that international trade is costless (in other words, there are no transaction costs associated with trade) and the country has a single trading partner. Note that $P_w$ = \\$302 and represents the equilibrium world price, and $P_w^{'}$ = \\$306 and represents the world price with a tariff.\n\nWhat quantity of this good is imported or exported at the world price before the tariff is imposed?",
